{"id": "22", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia's Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They ensure the delivery of quality behavioral health services to Virginia Medicaid enrollees and work towards improving the overall health and well-being of Virginians. They also offer continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses and host weekly Q&A sessions for providers to address their questions and issues.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services in Virginia. They are selected by the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services (DMAS) to serve as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator (BHSA) for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. Magellan ensures quality behavioral health services are delivered to Virginia Medicaid enrollees, partnering with members, providers, and stakeholders to improve the overall health and well-being of Virginians.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services in Virginia. They are selected by the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services (DMAS) to serve as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator (BHSA) for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. Magellan ensures quality behavioral health services are delivered to Virginia Medicaid enrollees, partnering with members, providers, and stakeholders to improve the overall health and well-being of Virginians.", "time_sec": 3.967, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 6879, 84786, 315, 12989, 374, 264, 9109, 315, 35595, 2820, 3516, 304, 12989, 13, 2379, 525, 4091, 553, 279, 12989, 5887, 315, 12939, 45765, 8307, 320, 8395, 1911, 8, 311, 8683, 438, 279, 71984, 6