{"id": "55", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "You can prevent birds from building nests on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch and the top of the porch if it has open rafters. This will block the birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. If you have a light fixture, you can also install bird netting over it, but make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs and doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as this can scare birds away. Remember to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "time_sec": 5.299, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0553, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0091, -0.0006, -0.0575, -0.4115, -0.0003, -0.0434, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0057, -0.0021, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2089, -0.9227, -0.0646, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.154, -0.0069, -0.0575, -0.0551, -0.1574, -0.0046, -0.0023, -0.0343, -0.079, -0.0001, -0.4051, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.3652, -1.2264, -0.013, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0506, -0.006, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0015, -0.001, -0.0001, -0.0576, -0.5543, -0.0077, -0.0, -0.394, -0.0433, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0043, -0.0696, -0.0002, -0.0123, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.1078, -1.3782, -0.0, -0.2549, -0.0102, -0.3932, -0.0631, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0002, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.0786, -0.0033, -0.0003, -0.0356, -0.0051, -0.0636, -0.0007, -0.005, -0.0, -0.0095, -0.0024, -0.5689, -0.5936, -0.0118, -0.5765, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0935, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.2336, -0.3011, -0.0, -0.0187, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0228, -0.0004, -0.0009, -0.0053, -0.0, -0.01, -0.0108, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0132, -0.82, -0.2221, -0.0849, -0.0027, -0.0007, -0.0082, -0.0, -0.0187, -0.0004, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0013, -0.2863, -0.3663, -0.0009, -0.3569, -1.1939], "cumulative_logprob": -13.7933, "norm_logp": -0.0896, "input_len": 570, "output_tokens": 154, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 67.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "58", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building nests on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun. This will prevent birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests, which can block your ventilation systems, are made from flammable materials, and bird droppings can transmit disease. (Passage 1:4)\n2. Install bird netting over the top of your light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is non-flammable and safe to use around light bulbs, and make sure it is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. (Passage 2:1)\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch. The sight of a predator can scare the birds away from the area and keep them from inhabiting your porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically to keep the birds from becoming accustomed to its presence. (Passage 3:1)\n\nTherefore, based on the provided passages, you can keep birds from building nests on your porch by using bird netting, installing bird netting over your light fixture, or mounting a plastic hawk near your porch.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "time_sec": 5.896, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0553, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0091, -0.0006, -0.0575, -0.4115, -0.0003, -0.0434, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0057, -0.0021, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2089, -0.9227, -0.0646, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.154, -0.0069, -0.0575, -0.0551, -0.1574, -0.0046, -0.0023, -0.0343, -0.079, -0.0001, -0.4051, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.3652, -1.