{"id": "60", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it.\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is:\n\nAttach bird netting to the eaves or install bird netting over the light fixture, and/or mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "time_sec": 5.722, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0553, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0091, -0.0006, -0.0575, -0.4115, -0.0003, -0.0434, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0057, -0.0021, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2089, -0.9227, -0.0646, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.154, -0.0069, -0.0575, -0.0551, -0.1574, -0.0046, -0.0023, -0.0343, -0.079, -0.0001, -0.4051, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.3652, -1.2264, -0.013, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0506, -0.006, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0015, -0.001, -0.0001, -0.0576, -0.5543, -0.0077, -0.0, -0.394, -0.0433, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0043, -0.0696, -0.0002, -0.0123, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.1078, -1.3782, -0.0, -0.2549, -0.0102, -0.3932, -0.0631, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0002, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.0786, -0.0033, -0.0003, -0.0356, -0.0051, -0.0636, -0.0007, -0.005, -0.0, -0.0095, -0.0024, -0.5689, -0.5