{"id": "63", "question": "set default browser to windows", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here are the steps to set the default browser to Windows:\n\nMethod 1:\n\n1. Open the Settings app by clicking the Start menu and then clicking the Settings icon, or by using the Windows + I keyboard shortcut.\n2. In the Settings app, click the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\n4. On the right-side, scroll down the page to see Web browser section.\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as default browser.\n\nAlternatively, you can also set Mozilla Firefox as your default Windows browser by following these steps:\n\n1. Open your Firefox browser.\n2. Click on the Firefox menu button, represented by three horizontal lines and located in the upper right-hand corner of the browser window.\n3. When the pop-out menu appears, select Options.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "These steps are specific to setting Google Chrome as the default browser. For other browsers like Mozilla Firefox, the process is slightly different.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open the Settings app by clicking the Settings icon in the Start menu or using the Windows + I keyboard shortcut.\n2. Click on the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\n4. Scroll down to the Web browser section.\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as the default browser.\n\nThese steps are specific to setting Google Chrome as the default browser. For other browsers like Mozilla Firefox, the process is slightly different.", "time_sec": 5.281, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 738, 279, 1638, 6929, 304, 5515, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 18458, 279, 11296, 4603, 304, 279, 5145, 5022, 476, 1667, 279, 5515, 488, 358, 13625, 37115, 624, 17, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 1156, 2999, 24849, 739, 320, 5493, 11, 21969, 11, 10500, 11, 2355, 4292, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 38452, 11, 4205, 7899, 10500, 624, 19, 13, 22392, 1495, 311, 279, 4895, 6929, 3772, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 10349, 6929, 4343, 320, 269, 894, 6929, 1008, 1091, 17225, 8, 311, 16400, 22201, 458, 906, 11, 323, 1221, 4205, 5085, 17225, 311, 738, 432, 438, 279, 1638, 6929, 382, 9485, 7354, 525, 3151, 311, 6243, 5085, 17225, 438, 279, 1638, 6929, 13, 1752, 1008, 32857, 1075, 34733, 25929, 11, 279, 1882, 374, 10078, 2155, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1173, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0242, -0.0008, -0.116, -0.3353, -0.0002, -0.2998, -0.0014, -0.0214, -0.7681, -0.0014, -0.7465, -0.2725, -0.0454, -0.0115, -0.2899, -0.1426, -0.0011, -0.737, -0.4038, -0.0481, -0.0013, -0.9287, -0.9731, -0.4435, -0.2225, -0.0002, -0.2948, -0.003, -0.0011, -0.0003, -0.1086, -0.0592, -0.0033, -0.0736, -0.0015, -0.0001, -0.0497, -0.0001, -0.151, -0.0058, -0.0001, -0.5534, -0.5287, -0.0431, -0.459, -0.0005, -0.0106, -0.4141, -0.5045, -0.0939, -0.0002, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0454, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0202, -0.0, -0.0022, -0.0023, -0.0092, -0.0042, -0.0675, -0.0006, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.7709, -0.0037, -0.5344, -0.1752, -0.0038, -0.0044, -0.0001, -0.3048, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0736, -0.0039, -0.0381, -1.3325, -0.003, -0.0132, -0.4097, -0.008, -0.0527, -0.1297, -0.0054, -0.0001, -0.0074, -0.1402, -0.0645, -0.0081, -0.2608, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.3684, -0.0236, -0.006, -0.042, -0.5649, -0.0002, -0.0236, -0.0004, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.396, -0.0002, -0.0053, -0.8411, -1.5306, -0.0126, -1.2872, -1.5928, -0.0976