{"id": "101", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n2. Download the audiobook you want from iTunes.\n3. Connect your iPhone to the computer via USB cable.\n4. Click on \"Audiobooks\" on the left task pane of the iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobook you want to sync by clicking on its title.\n6. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer.\n7. Click \"Apply\" to start the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes. The software allows two-way transfer of files, so you can not only backup files to your PC but also transfer audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone. Here are the steps to use Syncios Audiobook Transfer:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to the computer via USB cable.\n3. Click on \"Audiobooks\" on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer and click \"Export\" to save them to your computer.\n5. Alternatively, you can also click \"Import\" to add new audiobooks from your computer to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" to start the transfer process.\n\nNote that the above steps are based on the assumption that you have already turned on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes. If you have not done so, you will need to do so before attempting to sync your audiobooks.", "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "time_sec": 3.817, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 553, 13295, 279, 3745, 1790, 311, 1181, 2265, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.5244, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.082, -0.0016, -0.1096, -0.4063, -0.0122, -0.5815, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.1494, -0.0016, -0.0029, -0.0017, -0.2834, -0.1823, -0.0031, -0.0135, -0.4186, -0.0081, -0.0001, -1.0379, -0.2259, -0.001, -0.0035, -0.683, -0.2614, -0.1313, -0.1278, -0.001, -0.0006, -0.0312, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.2347, -0.0387, -0.0636, -0.1128, -0.0007, -0.0898, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.8159, -0.202, -0.2027, -1.1147, -0.393, -0.5764, -0.0008, -0.185, -0.0413, -0.3958, -0.2409, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3023, -0.0001, -0.0, -1.3712, -0.0033, -0