{"id": "114", "question": "how are water shares transferred", "gt": "Water shares are transferred by following a set of steps. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate and sign the back of the certificate. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process the transfer. After completing these steps, a new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, water shares are transferred through the following steps:\n\n1. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate that was assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate.\n2. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process a Water Stock Certificate transfer.\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, water shares are transferred through the following steps:\n\n1. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate that was assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate.\n2. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process a Water Stock Certificate transfer.\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.", "time_sec": 3.09, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 3015, 13248, 525, 22409, 1526, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 576, 22856, 1969, 470, 279, 9959, 12648, 31402, 429, 572, 12607, 311, 1105, 323, 1841, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 15748, 624, 17, 13, 576, 501, 6372, 315, 279, 3343, 1969, 3410, 11064, 315, 15278, 624, 18, 13, 362, 11060, 315, 400, 22, 20, 13, 15, 15, 1969, 387, 7171, 311, 1882, 264, 9959, 12648, 31402, 8317, 624, 19, 13, 362, 501, 9959, 12648, 31402, 686, 387, 10897, 311, 279, 501, 6372, 315, 3255, 13, 151645], "logp_li