{"id": "120", "question": "teresa name meaning", "gt": "The name Teresa is of Greek origin and means \"Reap; from Therasia\" or \"Harvester\". It is also a Spanish and Italian name and is associated with two popular saints, Teresa of Avila and Therese of Lisieux. The name Theresa is a variation of Teresa and also means \"Reaper; from Therasia\". The etymology of the name is uncertain, but it is thought to come from the Greek words \"therizein\" meaning \"to harvest, harvester\" or \"theros\" meaning \"summer\".", "pred": "The name Theresa is also mentioned, which is a Greek baby name with a similar meaning to Teresa. In Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the name Teresa has different meanings depending on its origin:\n\n1. Greek Meaning: The name Teresa is a Greek baby name. In Greek, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n2. American Meaning: The name Teresa is an American baby name. In American, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n3. Italian Meaning: The name Teresa is an Italian baby name. In Italian, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Harvester.\"\n4. Spanish Meaning: The name Teresa is a Spanish baby name. In Spanish, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\"\n\nThe name Theresa is also mentioned, which is a Greek baby name with a similar meaning to Teresa. In Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "time_sec": 7.156, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 702, 2155, 49700, 11649, 389, 1181, 6238, 1447, 16, 13, 17860, 48103, 25, 576, 829, 63440, 374, 264, 17860, 8770, 829, 13, 758, 17860, 11, 279, 7290, 315, 279, 829, 63440, 374, 330, 693, 391, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 10040, 17, 13, 3693, 4810