, -0.0011, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0011, -0.0029, -0.0072, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.6914, -0.2651, -1.3583, -0.5169, -0.6385, -0.9945, -0.4712, -0.5974, -0.8481, -0.8155, -0.5669, -0.8627, -0.1141, -0.0378, -0.0, -0.8435, -0.6839, -0.2848, -0.2083, -1.3468, -0.0234, -1.0178, -1.259, -0.0352, -0.0027, -0.061, -0.0557, -0.0076, -0.022, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0003, -0.0036, -0.0006, -0.0012, -0.001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.4132, -0.3854], "cumulative_logprob": -24.9839, "norm_logp": -0.1262, "input_len": 652, "output_tokens": 198, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.94, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "124", "question": "building a lean-to shed", "gt": "To build a lean-to shed, start by preparing the site with a 4\" layer of compacted gravel. Cut two 4 x 4 skids to a length of 70 2/4\" and set and level them according to the shed building plans. Cut two 2 x 6 rim joists at 7 3/4\" and six joists at 44 3/4\". Assemble the floor and place it on the skids as indicated in the floor framing section of the plans. Check for squareness and anchor the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles. Cut two more 4 x 4s to a length of 6 feet for the skids and, when the frame is square, toenail the floor joists to the skids. Attach 3/4-inch tongue-and-groove plywood flooring onto the frame. The walls for the shed are constructed separately and then raised onto the frame. The size of the shed can be adjusted as needed.", "pred": "1. Prepare the site with a 4-inch layer of compacted gravel.\n2. Cut two 4 x 4 skids at 70 2/4 inches.\n3. Set and level the skids following the shed building plans.\n4. Cut two 2 x 6 rim joists at 7 3/4 inches and six joists at 44 3/4 inches.\n5. Assemble the floor and set it on the skids as shown in the floor framing section of the lean-to shed plans.\n6. Check for square, and then anchor the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles.\n7. Cut two pressure-treated 4 by 4s to a length of 6 feet for the skids.\n8. Position the frame on the skids, and, when square, toenail the floor joists to the skids.\n9. Attach 3/4-inch tongue-and-groove plywood flooring onto the frame.\n10. The walls for the shed are constructed separately and then raised onto the frame.\n11. The shed dimensions are 6 feet long by 4 feet wide, with the option to expand in increments of 2 or 4 feet.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, building a lean-to shed involves several steps:\n\n1. Prepare the site with a 4-inch layer of compacted gravel.\n2. Cut two 4 x 4 skids at 70 2/4 inches.\n3. Set and level the skids following the shed building plans.\n4. Cut two 2 x 6 rim joists at 7 3/4 inches and six joists at 44 3/4 inches.\n5. Assemble the floor and set it on the skids as shown in the floor framing section of the lean-to shed plans.\n6. Check for square, and then anchor the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles.\n7. Cut two pressure-treated 4 by 4s to a length of 6 feet for the skids.\n8. Position the frame on the skids, and, when square, toenail the floor joists to the skids.\n9. Attach 3/4-inch tongue-and-groove plywood flooring onto the frame.\n10. The walls for the shed are constructed separately and then raised onto the frame.\n11. The shed dimensions are 6 feet long by 4 feet wide, with the option to expand in increments of 2 or 4 feet.", "time_sec": 9.52, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 4752, 264, 15651, 4686, 24354, 17601, 3807, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 31166, 279, 2747, 448, 264, 220, 19, 24241, 6193, 315, 16830, 291, 41523, 624, 17, 13, 19649, 1378, 220, 19, 856, 220, 19, 1901, 3365, 518, 220, 22, 15, 220, 17, 14, 19, 14924, 624, 18, 13, 2573, 323, 2188, 279, 1901, 3365, 2701, 279, 24354, 4752, 6649, 624, 19, 13, 19649, 1378, 220, 17, 856, 220, 21, 30130, 7647, 1671, 518, 220, 22, 220, 18, 14, 19, 14924, 323, 4743, 7647, 1671, 518, 220, 19, 19, 220, 18, 14, 19, 14924, 624, 20, 13, 1634, 15790, 279, 6422, 323, 738, 432, 389, 279, 1901, 3365, 438, 6839, 304, 279, 6422, 57949, 3772, 315, 279, 15651, 4686, 24354, 6649, 624, 21, 13, 4248, 369, 9334, 11, 323, 1221, 17105, 279, 4034, 311, 279, 1901, 3365, 448, 3040, 7647, 380, 12327, 25941, 624, 22, 13, 19649, 1378, 7262, 87086, 220, 19, 553, 220, 19, 82, 311, 264, 3084, 315, 220, 21, 7541, 369, 279, 1901, 3365, 624, 23, 13, 12380, 279, 4034, 389, 279, 1901, 3365, 11, 323, 11, 979, 9334, 11, 99034, 604, 279, 6422, 7647, 1671, 311, 279, 1901, 3365, 624, 24, 13, 48384, 220, 18, 14, 19, 24241, 24459, 9777, 2371, 299, 994, 87898, 