{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "time_sec": 3.587, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15