{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "time_sec": 3.671, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 3