{"id": "266", "question": "introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer", "gt": "Visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their store and influence their buying behavior. It involves the presentation of the store and its merchandise in a way that aligns with the retailer's goals and marketing strategy. The visual merchandiser's role is crucial as they not only help bring customers to the store but also influence their purchasing decisions, akin to \"making the horse drink\" as per G. Surrendar's analogy. Particularly, visual merchandising related to shop windows has been found to significantly impact consumer buying behavior, with variations observed based on gender and the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their stores. It involves creating an appealing visual display that aligns with the retail strategy and company goals. This approach is more effective than relying solely on advertising, as it engages customers directly in the store environment. Visual merchandising is crucial in influencing consumer behavior, particularly in shopping centers, where it can impact the buying decisions of different genders and influence the perception of store attributes.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their stores. It involves creating an appealing visual display that aligns with the retail strategy and company goals. This approach is more effective than relying solely on advertising, as it engages customers directly in the store environment. Visual merchandising is crucial in influencing consumer behavior, particularly in shopping centers, where it can impact the buying decisions of different genders and influence the perception of store attributes.", "time_sec": 3.371, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 264, 8282, 1483, 553, 29182, 311, 9320, 6310, 311, 862, 10533, 13, 1084, 17601, 6825, 458, 32252, 9124, 3037, 429, 5285, 82, 448, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 2813, 8845, 13, 1096, 5486, 374, 803, 7373, 1091, 38561, 21063, 389, 12876, 11, 438, 432, 68489, 6310, 5961, 304, 279, 3553, 4573, 13, 20185, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 16587, 304, 65600, 11502, 7709, 11, 7945, 304, 11919, 18652, 11, 1380, 432, 646, 5421, 279, 11833, 11181, 315, 2155, 81328, 323, 10173, 279, 20431, 315, 3553, 8201, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0945, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0094, -0.0008, -0.0975, -0.2189, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0129, -0.907, -0.67, -1.019, -0.7204, -0.092, -0.0108, -0.0134, -0.5614, -0.3675, -0.8677, -0.5882, -0.0492, -0.7811, -0.7014, -0.408, -0.9441, -0.5414, -0.2053, -0.9099, -0.5608, -0.9139, -1.0636, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0008, -0.8035, -0.0056, -0.0016, -0.1756, -0.0005, -0.2537, -1.4333, -0.9213, -0.8696, -1.5077, -0.1669, -0.0156, -0.9556, -0.0124, -0.0, -0.1954, -1.0504, -0.0655, -0.2168, -1.5671, -0.1385, -0.9605, -0.9869, -0.0667, -0.0642, -0.8361, -0.341, -0.8205, -0.001, -0.0, -0.0372, -1.3668, -1.3417, -0.6543, -0.7587, -0.0234, -0.5958, -0.2778, -0.4884, -0.9487, -1.1512, -0.0219, -0.4264, -0.8106, -0.7729, -0.2872, -0.9412, -0.9946, -2.1231, -0.1074, -0.0494, -0.9986, -1.125, -0.6728, -1.2053, -0.5871, -1.4984, -0.0068, -0.2291, -0.0033, -0.4693, -0.4354], "cumulative_logprob": -49.1745, "norm_logp": -0.507, "input_len": 401, "output_tokens": 97, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "time_sec": 2.38, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 320, 1958, 1045, 3198, 340, 23, 13, 444, 1090, 11417, 291, 2090, 476, 294, 96645, 4152, 311, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 5943, 304, 6543, 7262, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2576, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0246, -0.0007, -0.0667, -0.1136, -0.0026, -0.0129, -0.062, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.2986, -0.7924, -0.1013, -0.0003, -0.9754, -0.0, -0.0298, -0.5316, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0375, -0.0, -0.0349, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0055, -0.0, -0.0111, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0029, -0.0002, -0.484, -0.4553, -0.0001, -0.1213, -0.0013, -0.4728, -0.0028, -0.0, -0.1557, -0.0002, -0.4708, -0.1443, -0.0, -0.0433, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2387, -0.0073, -0.9277, -1.2166, -0.2329, -0.0929, -0.5093, -0.3031, -0.0, -1.8054, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0232, -0.338, -0.1242, -0.0001, -1