{"id": "291", "question": "how to cook a frozen pork loin roast in the oven", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to cook a frozen pork loin roast in the oven:\n\n1. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.\n2. Place the frozen pork loin in a shallow baking pan on top of a roasting rack with the fat of the pork loin facing upwards.\n3. Cook the pork loin for about 20-30 minutes per pound.\n4. Insert a meat thermometer and test the meat after cooking.\n5. When the internal temperature of the meat reaches 150 degrees Fahrenheit, cover the roast with aluminum foil and let it sit for 30 minutes before serving.\n\nSo, the steps to cook a frozen pork loin roast in the oven are: preheat the oven, place the roast in a shallow baking pan, cook for 20-30 minutes per pound, check the internal temperature, cover and let it sit before serving.", "pred": "1. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.\n2. Place the frozen pork loin in a shallow baking pan on top of a roasting rack with the fat of the pork loin facing upwards.\n3. Cook the pork loin for about 20-30 minutes per pound.\n4. Insert a meat thermometer and test the meat after cooking.\n5. When the internal temperature of the meat reaches 150 degrees Fahrenheit, the meat is ready to be taken out of the oven.\n6. Cover the roast with aluminum foil and let it sit for 30 minutes before serving.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to cook a frozen pork loin roast in the oven, follow these steps:\n\n1. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.\n2. Place the frozen pork loin in a shallow baking pan on top of a roasting rack with the fat of the pork loin facing upwards.\n3. Cook the pork loin for about 20-30 minutes per pound.\n4. Insert a meat thermometer and test the meat after cooking.\n5. When the internal temperature of the meat reaches 150 degrees Fahrenheit, the meat is ready to be taken out of the oven.\n6. Cover the roast with aluminum foil and let it sit for 30 minutes before serving.", "time_sec": 5.628, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4296, 264, 19690, 35067, 76960, 57685, 304, 279, 23387, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 279, 23387, 311, 220, 18, 20, 15, 12348, 68723, 624, 17, 13, 10771, 279, 19690, 35067, 76960, 304, 264, 25600, 27815, 7215, 389, 1909, 315, 264, 926, 14725, 29659, 448, 279, 8664, 315, 279, 35067, 76960, 12880, 43954, 624, 18, 13, 12514, 279, 35067, 76960, 369, 911, 220, 17, 15, 12, 18, 15, 4420, 817, 30023, 624, 19, 13, 17101, 264, 13041, 92197, 323, 1273, 279, 13041, 1283, 17233, 624, 20, 13, 3197, 279, 5306, 9315, 315, 279, 13041, 24491, 220, 16, 20, 15, 12348, 68723, 11, 279, 13041, 374, 5527, 311, 387, 4429, 700, 315, 279, 23387, 624, 21, 13, 17757, 279, 57685, 448, 24649, 46399, 323, 1077, 432, 2444, 369, 220, 18, 15, 4420, 1573, 13480, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.6229, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0445, -0.0022, -0.1755, -0.2004, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0026, -0.003, -0.0002, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.6568, -0.3557, -0.0021, -0.0073, -0.5529, -0.0029, -0.0001, -0.147, -0.0003, -0.429, -0.0, -0.0017, -0.0024, -0.0011, -0.0112, -0.0, -0.0038, -0.0032, -0.0582, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.6398, -0.0021, -0.0112, -0.0002, -0.0007, -0.4632, -0.0002, -0.002, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0493, -0.0077, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2739, -0.0001, -0.001, -0.0952, -0.0, -0.001, -0.0036, -0.0, -0.0027, -0.0203, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0403, -0.0042, -0.0016, -0.0009, -0.0025, -0.0266, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0077, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.2777, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0062, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.4743, -0.04, -0.0004, -0.0102, -0.0256, -0.0029, -0.1536, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.1334, -0.0032, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0095, -0.0, -0.0039, -0.3489, -0.0006, -0.0001, -0.0095, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.1702, -0.2929, -0.0001, -0.007, -0.1498, -0.0024, -0.0088, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0, -0.