{"id": "343", "question": "when you have a bowel movement do you lose weight", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it is clear that having a bowel movement does not result in weight loss. Weight loss is primarily determined by caloric intake and expenditure, not by bowel movements.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, when you have a bowel movement, you do not lose weight. The weight loss is due to a calorie deficit, which forces your body to burn stored fat for energy. The weight you lose after a bowel movement is not from a loss of body fat in the stool, but rather from dietary fat intake that is not properly absorbed.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, when you have a bowel movement, you do not lose weight. The weight loss is due to a calorie deficit, which forces your body to burn stored fat for energy. The weight you lose after a bowel movement is not from a loss of body fat in the stool, but rather from dietary fat intake that is not properly absorbed.", "time_sec": 2.31, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 979, 498, 614, 264, 65258, 7203, 11, 498, 653, 537, 9052, 4680, 13, 576, 4680, 4709, 374, 4152, 311, 264, 51603, 28187, 11, 892, 8437, 697, 2487, 311, 8231, 9768, 8664, 369, 4802, 13, 576, 4680, 498, 9052, 1283, 264, 65258, 7203, 374, 537, 504, 264, 4709, 315, 2487, 8664, 304, 279, 63072, 11, 714, 4751, 504, 33525, 8664, 22881, 429, 374, 537, 10277, 41001, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1566, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0135, -0.0017, -0.0165, -0.8279, -0.0025, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1041, -0.0359, -0.3116, -0.0033, -0.1254, -0.0533, -0.1909, -0.3681, -1.219, -0.5188, -1.0854, -1.0907, -0.0, -0.4668, -0.3378, -0.0022, -0.3714, -0.5979, -0.151, -0.252, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0076, -0.0027, -0.0056, -0.0348, -0.0, -0.2644, -0.8197, -1.3017, -1.2383, -0.7834, -0.7566, -0.1402, -0.0007, -0.0002, -0.5258, -0.1674, -0.3965, 