{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits:\n\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It helps combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.\n\n2. **Physical Fitness**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness, depending on how hard one pushes during a hike.\n\n3. **Accessibility**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, which is a good way of getting to know an area.\n\n4. **Sunlight Exposure**: Being exposed to sunshine while hiking increases levels of vitamin D, which is beneficial for overall health.\n\nThese benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "time_sec": 7.817, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 6081, 3807, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 44, 6296, 6267, 95518, 472, 19233, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 13, 1084, 8609, 12610, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 438, 1660, 304, 6993, 374, 80236, 2627, 304, 1039, 15552, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 39253, 35708, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 429, 646, 7949, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 5263, 8084, 17042, 11, 11649, 389, 1246, 2588, 825, 40702, 2337, 264, 34231, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 85369, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 7496, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 11, 892, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 315, 3709, 311, 1414, 458, 3082, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 30092, 4145, 70766, 95518, 20690, 14900, 311, 51395, 1393, 37364, 12703, 5866, 315, 27071, 422, 11, 892, 374, 23699, 369, 8084, 2820, 382, 9485, 7567, 11167, 279, 6785, 5421, 315, 37364, 389, 2176, 6961, 323, 10502, 1632, 32751, 11, 3259, 432, 264, 15172, 31528, 369, 7775, 3330, 311, 7269, 862, 2820, 323, 4564, 448, 6993, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0561, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0147, -0.0004, -0.0937, -0.6681, -0.6834, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.439, -0.2737, -0.0301, -1.2239, -0.0166, -0.0001, -0.6634, -0.4311, -0.0006, -0.0066, -0.5772, -0.2022, -0.0001, -0.4042, -0.004, -0.2047, -0.1909, -0.987, -0.5052, -0.0073, -0.0464, -0.4532, -0.5644, -0.0, -0.1206, -0.2936, -0.9742, -0.326, -0.8736, -0.034, -0.0066, -0.0003, -0.1845, -0.6633, -1.3509, -0.6619, -0.6808, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.689, -0.5176, -0.2969, -0.0006, -0.0001, -0.0401, -0.1119, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0902, -0.0003, -0.7621, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4314, -0.644, -0.0072, -0.