{"id": "478", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "gt": "Passage 3 provides information on how to change your address with the U.S. Postal Service. You can visit their website, call the USPS Call Center, or fill out and submit a form at a U.S. Post Office.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast and versatile change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service. The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure data safety. To change your address, you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast and versatile change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service. The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure data safety. To change your address, you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "time_sec": 4.258, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 6081, 264, 4937, 323, 31945, 2297, 315, 2621, 2473, 429, 646, 15456, 705, 311, 220, 16, 15, 15, 11104, 304, 5256, 311, 279, 54217, 5362, 13, 576, 2473, 374, 9767, 11, 1667, 279, 5535, 25463, 14310, 311, 5978, 821, 7149, 13, 2014, 2297, 697, 2621, 11, 498, 646, 3947, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 34545, 1618, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 701, 476, 5155, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 518, 894, 547, 808, 