{"id": "482", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "time_sec": 1.976, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0718, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.032, -0.0007, -0.024, -0.2615, -0.0013, -0.0779, -0.9559, -0.0221, -0.0002, -0.5685, -0.1057, -0.7713, -0.5776, -0.0018, -0.1005, -0.0272, -0.2389, -0.3533, -0.2354, -1.1666, -0.761, -0.6304, -0.1379, -0.093, -0.1914, -0.0018, -0.7105, -0.5097, -0.3977, -0.0023, -0.006, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.2592, -0.7167, -0.5436, -0.1796, -0.0176, -0.4286, -0.0404, -0.2818, -1.3925, -0.0, -1.0418, -0.9601, -0.9845, -0.0006, -0.8583, -1.2417, -0.427, -0.1975, -0.0414, -0.6067, -0.874, -0.0, -0.1277, -0.0007, -0.0987, -0.3136, -0.3153, -1.0116], "cumulative_logprob": -21.9981, "norm_logp": -0.3437, "input_len": 644, "output_tokens": 64, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "time_sec": 2.125, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0718, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.032, -0.0007, -0.024, -0.2615, -0.0013, -0.0779, -0.9559, -0.0221, -0.0002, -0.5685, -0.1057, -0.7713, -0.5776, -0.0018, -0.1005, -0.0272, -0.2389, -0.3533, -0.2354, -1.1666, -0.761, -0.6304, -0.1379, -0.093, -0.1914, -0.0018, -0.7105, -0.5097, -0.3977, -0.0023, -0.006, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.2592, -0.7167, -0.5436, -0.1796, -0.0176, -0.4286, -0.0404, -0.2818, -1.3925, -0.0, -1.0418, -0.9601, -0.9845, -0.0006, -0.8583, -1.2417, -0.427, -0.1975, -0.0414, -0.6067, -0.874, -0.0, -0.1277, -0.0007, -0.0987, -0.3136, -0.3153, -1.0116], "cumulative_logprob": -21.9981, "norm_logp": -0.3437, "input_len": 644, "output_tokens": 64, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "488", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "pred": "1. Check visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary visa for Germany.\n2. Determine the best time to visit: Consider the best time of year to travel to Germany based on weather and events.\n3. Research what to see: Look into popular attractions and cultural experiences in Germany.\n4. Plan your budget: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodation, and sightseeing.\n5. Consider traveling with pets: If you have pets, research pet-friendly accommodations and travel regulations.\n6. Learn about German culture: Understanding German life and culture can enhance your trip's enjoyment and understanding.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should consider the following steps:\n\n1. Check visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary visa for Germany.\n2. Determine the best time to visit: Consider the best time of year to travel to Germany based on weather and events.\n3. Research what to see: Look into popular attractions and cultural experiences in Germany.\n4. Plan your budget: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodation, and sightseeing.\n5. Consider traveling with pets: If you have pets, research pet-friendly accommodations and travel regulations.\n6. Learn about German culture: Understanding German life and culture can enhance your trip's enjoyment and understanding.", "time_sec": 5.081, "record_process": true, "token