{"id": "492", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, there are several ways to track who likes your tweets:\n\n1. Favotter.net and Favstar.fm - These websites allow you to track who has favorited your tweets and which tweets have been favorited by multiple users. (Passage 1)\n2. Using a web-based website - There are websites that allow you to check Twitter users who favorite tweets. (Passage 2)\n3. On Twitter - You can set up your account settings to receive notifications via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as a favorite. (Passage 3)\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question is: You can use Favotter.net, Favstar.fm, or a web-based website to track who likes your tweets, or you can set up your Twitter account settings to receive email notifications.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can tell who liked your tweet by using a website that tracks favorited tweets. One such website mentioned is Favotter.net. To use this website, you need to go to Twitter.com, log in with your Twitter username and password, click on your Twitter name located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, click on the Settings option that appears in the drop-down menu, and then click on the blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. This will allow you to set up your account so that you're notified via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can tell who liked your tweet by using a website that tracks favorited tweets. One such website mentioned is Favotter.net. To use this website, you need to go to Twitter.com, log in with your Twitter username and password, click on your Twitter name located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, click on the Settings option that appears in the drop-down menu, and then click on the blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. This will allow you to set up your account so that you're notified via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "time_sec": 4.696, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 553, 1667, 264, 3910, 429, 13918, 4694, 1608, 23150, 13, 3776, 1741, 3910, 9733, 374, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 13, 2014, 990, 419, 3910, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 728, 311, 6271, 905, 11, 1487, 304, 448, 697, 6271, 5934, 323, 3552, 11, 4205, 389, 697, 6271, 829, 7407, 389, 279, 8416, 1290, 1424, 9131, 315, 697, 2692, 594, 5379, 2150, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 11296, 2999, 429, 7952, 304, 279, 5943, 14875, 5022, 11, 323, 1221, 4205, 389, 279, 6303, 52938, 2656, 518, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 4171, 13, 1096, 686, 2138, 498, 311, 738, 705, 697, 2692, 773, 429, 498, 2299, 29216, 4566, 2551, 15356, 4325, 15423, 825, 315, 697, 23150, 438, 825, 315, 862, 26574, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0901, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0359, -0.0014, -0.065, -0.3914, -0.0018, -0.1752, -0.0003, -0.0013, -0.0025, -0.0095, -0.0659, -0.3186, -1.0194, -0.1961, -0.7874, -1.0179, -1.398, -0.019, -0.0011, -0.3099, -1.494, -0.2646, -0.1156, -0.6045, -0.5238, -0.0581, -0.0066, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.4447, -0.9215, -0.2385, -0.3623, -0.3106, -0.0311, -0.3779, -0.3177, -0.0013, -1.0555, -0.0014, -0.2885, -0.0435, -0.5765, -0.0037, -0.0006, -0.0543, -0.0, -0.1182, -0.0051, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0431, -0.3989, -0.0001, -0.0214, -0.0063, -0.0012, -0.6826, -0.085, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0033, -0.5848, -0.0008, -0.0061, -0.0142, -0.0013, -0.014, -0.0275, -0.0005, -0.0216, -0.737, -0.0003, -0.003, -0.0241, -0.0002, -0.1175, -0.0001, -0.0011, -0.0004, -0.0008, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0079, -0.1163, -0.2226, -0.0062, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0231, -0.0013, -0.0, -0.0043, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0005, -0.1418, -1.4858, -0.1041, -0.1689, -0.001, -0.0002, -0.2442, -0.0006, -0.235, -0.0011, -0.18