{"id": "509", "question": "what is the difference between sirloin steak and porterhouse steak", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the difference between sirloin steak and porterhouse steak is that porterhouse steak is a larger version of T-Bone steak and it contains more of the tenderloin or fillet than T-Bone steak.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between sirloin steak and porterhouse steak is that the sirloin steak is a steak cut from the back of the animal, while the porterhouse steak is cut from further back on the sirloin and therefore contains a bit more of the tenderloin or fillet.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between sirloin steak and porterhouse steak is that the sirloin steak is a steak cut from the back of the animal, while the porterhouse steak is cut from further back on the sirloin and therefore contains a bit more of the tenderloin or fillet.", "time_sec": 1.934, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 27048, 385, 258, 48959, 323, 87186, 7675, 48959, 374, 429, 279, 27048, 385, 258, 48959, 374, 264, 48959, 3931, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 9864, 11, 1393, 279, 87186, 7675, 48959, 374, 3931, 504, 4623, 1182, 389, 279, 27048, 385, 258, 323, 8916, 5610, 264, 2699, 803, 315, 279, 27582, 385, 258, 476, 1461, 1149, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1848, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0134, -0.0011, -0.0515, -0.1202, -0.123, -0.0009, -0.4942, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.0281, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.4244, -0.1331, -1.2287, -0.341, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0429, -0.006, -0.7053, -0.3782, -0.0002, -0.0029, -0.0088, -0.0741, -0.0106, -0.0003, -0.0014, -0.1122, -0.5484, -0.0738, -0.0208, -0.0001, -0.0117, -0.0451, -0.2991, -0.1043, -0.2359, -0.0, -0.0293, -0.0, -0.0065, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4643, -0.5726, -0.0015, -0.18, -0.0018, -0.0, -0.0142, -0.0, -0.0033, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0794, -0.007, -0.0, -