{"id": "533", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an injured arm, securing a bandana over a bleeding wound, and helping to keep a severe wound closed. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes:\n\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg.\n3. Keeping a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\n4. Removing splinters in the wilderness.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes:\n\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg.\n3. Keeping a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\n4. Removing splinters in the wilderness.", "time_sec": 3.031, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 7149, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 3807, 9895, 1447, 16, 13, 15335, 27929, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 624, 17, 13, 4520, 1677, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 624, 18, 13, 55378, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 624, 19, 13, 66703, 12503, 49940, 304, 279, 48262, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0765, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0206, -0.0015, -0.0424, -0.0094, -0.0001, -0.1675, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0028, -0.0161, -0.1159, -0.0069, -0.0081, -0