{"id": "542", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "time_sec": 2.821, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 5257, 24055, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 1899, 315, 279, 2254, 1447, 12, 6527, 220, 16, 25, 13047, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 13, 7107, 979, 304, 2524, 11, 714, 646, 387, 73697, 624, 12, 6527, 220, 20, 25, 9063, 1717, 518, 4746, 714, 156