{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).", "time_sec": 1.554, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 2736, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 990, 279, 2701, 3137, 27459, 1447, 16, 13, 12836, 619, 49328, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 1959, 34469, 320, 6282, 8, 488, 27974, 320, 30047, 568, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1161, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0186, -0.0032, -0.0817, -0.3965, -0.981, -0.5761, -0.2738, -0.3897, -0.2358, -0.0014, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0182, -0.0936, -0.0013, -0.1659, -0.357, -0.4749, -0.002, -0.563, -0.6352, -0.592, -0.0646, -0.5779, -1.0759, -0.1396, -0.0002, -0.359, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0641, -0.005, -0.0002, -0.4535, -0.404, -0.2092, -0.0035, -0.0036, -0.0006, -0.0023, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.7982, -0.0545], "cumulative_logprob": -10.1944, "norm_logp": -0.208, "input_len": 447, "output_tokens": 49, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "573", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "time_sec": 3.164, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 249