{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "time_sec": 2.996, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "logp_list": 