{"id": "580", "question": "what do i do if i got my sperrys wet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperry shoes get wet, it is recommended to use a leather conditioner to help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your shoes with detergent, as it tends to dry out the leather. If you don't have a leather conditioner on hand, you can use a suede bar or leather brush to clean the shoes. It's best to avoid getting light tan Sperry shoes wet, as water might stain them. However, if you do get them wet, using a suede bar or leather brush should help remove any stains.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.", "time_sec": 3.069, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 498, 2684, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 14401, 11, 498, 1265, 990, 264, 17553, 64324, 311, 5772, 34313, 279, 17553, 323, 4132, 810, 31157, 1182, 1119, 432, 13, 1096, 374, 5310, 2989, 421, 498, 11369, 697, 3089, 5400, 15294, 448, 90134, 11, 438, 90134, 702, 264, 30854, 311, 9058, 279, 17553, 700, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 96635, 3