{"id": "592", "question": "where does 1099-patr go on 1040", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the answer to the question \"Where does 1099-PATR go on 1040?\" is:\n\nSchedule C, Schedule F, or Form 4835.\n\nAccording to the instructions for Form 1099-PATR, patronage dividends and other distributions in boxes 1, 2, 3, and 5 from a cooperative are reported on one of these forms.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 0.281, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.6495, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0036, -0.0, -0.0559, -0.0009], "cumulative_logprob": -0.7105, "norm_logp": -0.0789, "input_len": 427, "output_tokens": 9, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
