{"id": "602", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "gt": "Based on the given passages, both exercise cycling and aerobic exercise are beneficial for overall fitness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may not be ideal for individuals who, due to arthritic or other orthopedic problems, are unable to walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. The indoor exercise, or stationary, bike provides you with the lowest impact workout compared to the treadmill and rowing machine, according to WebMD. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may not be ideal for individuals who, due to arthritic or other orthopedic problems, are unable to walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. The indoor exercise, or stationary, bike provides you with the lowest impact workout compared to the treadmill and rowing machine, according to WebMD. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.", "time_sec": 4.344, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 90390, 10158, 374, 2664, 1091, 32062, 13, 63050, 30806, 10158, 11, 1741, 438, 4303, 476, 32062, 11, 374, 1661, 369, 498, 7241, 498, 525, 264, 14680, 3746, 1515, 13, 59970, 374, 2441, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 448, 6884, 14303, 323, 897, 11, 714, 432, 1231, 537, 387, 10507, 369, 7775, 879, 11, 4152, 311, 796, 339, 49208, 476, 1008, 29199, 16367, 292, 5322, 1