{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\n\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "time_sec": 4.356, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 624, 17, 13, 16516, 47