{"id": "639", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños have various health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestion, prevention of heart disease and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they have cardiovascular health benefits.", "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\n\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "time_sec": 4.5, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 624, 17, 13, 16516, 4709, 25, 2379, 646, 387, 264, 47251, 10555, 311, 1492, 448, 4680, 4709, 624, 18, 13, 38222, 278, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 25, 71895, 39