{"id": "677", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from abdominal pain and aiding digestion. The side effects of drinking clove tea are not mentioned in the given passages.", "pred": "There are no side effects mentioned in the provided passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include:\n\n1. Soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body.\n2. Providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey.\n3. Having skin benefits, although specific details are not provided.\n4. Relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries due to its analgesic effects.\n5. Being applied to unbroken skin for pain relief.\n6. Working better with arthritic pain when applied as a warm tea compress.\n7. Soothing abdominal pain and aiding in digestion for those suffering from gas pain or other stomach upset.\n8. Stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion.\n\nThere are no side effects mentioned in the provided passages.", "time_sec": 5.494, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 2055, 78, 1596, 279, 37107, 323, 58544, 4405, 8464, 304, 279, 2487, 624, 17, 13, 80100, 15957, 504, 8464, 979, 9519, 448, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 304, 3015, 323, 4429, 448, 25744, 624, 18, 13, 20035, 6787, 7567, 11, 7892, 3151, 3565, 525, 537, 3897, 624, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 4152, 311, 1181, 3181, 4188, 292, 6239, 624, 20, 13, 20690, 9251, 311, 650, 48909, 6787, 369, 6646, 15957, 624, 21, 13, 22150, 2664, 448, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 979, 9251, 438,