{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\n\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\n\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.", "time_sec": 3.054, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 633, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 264, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 279, 13370, 5496, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 20145, 905, 11739, 14, 6198, 321, 17, 15, 18, 22, 624, 17, 13, 10357, 279, 2766, 429, 4933, 1246, 311, 633, 264, 1910, 20721, 14307, 5624, 320, 11169, 3298, 4292, 18, 13, 2126, 697