{"id": "686", "question": "michigan-how much to replace sewer lines", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan can vary significantly depending on the extent of the damage and the location of the pipe. If a section of the pipe is beyond repair, it may require pipe replacement, which could cost from $3,000 to around $12,000. If the entire sewer line needs to be replaced, the cost could be even higher. The cost of a sewer line repair or replacement could break the bank.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan can vary significantly depending on the extent of the damage and the location of the pipe. If a section of the pipe is beyond repair, it may require pipe replacement, which could cost from $3,000 to around $12,000. If the entire sewer line needs to be replaced, the cost could be even higher. The cost of a sewer line repair or replacement could break the bank.", "time_sec": 2.903, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 2783, 315, 24891, 61920, 5128, 304, 14630, 646, 13289, 11941, 11649, 389, 279, 12818, 315, 279, 5557, 323, 279, 3728, 315, 279, 13647, 13, 1416, 264, 3772, 315, 279, 13647, 374, 7797, 12733, 11, 432, 1231, 1373, 13647, 13723, 11, 892, 1410, 2783, 504, 400, 18, 11, 15, 15, 15, 311, 2163, 400, 16, 17, 11, 15, 15, 15, 13, 1416, 279, 4453, 61920, 1555, 3880, 311, 387, 12575, 11, 279, 2783, 1410, 387, 1496, 5080, 13, 576, 2783, 315, 264, 61920, 1555, 12733, 476, 13723, 1410, 1438, 279, 6073, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1069, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0179, -0.0008, -0.0418, -0.1641, -0.0091, -0.6668, -0.0212, -0.0907, -0.0004, -0.7285, -0.004, -0.0698, -0.5709, -0.4915, -0.6027, -0.0, -0.5456, -0.0341, -0.0125, -0.1803, -0.005, -0.5358, -0.1696, -0.9537, -0.0802, -0.0002, -0.1086, 