{"id": "728", "question": "weather in wellesley", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley for Tuesday, August 23rd is expected to be sunny with a high of 82 degrees and a 39% chance of rain. The wind speed is expected to be 10 mph from the north-northwest.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley on August 23 is forecasted to be 82 degrees and Sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On August 24, the forecast is 79 degrees and Sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. On August 18, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On August 19, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On August 21, the forecast is 81 degrees and Sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. On August 22, there is moderate or heavy rain in the area with thunder, with a 52% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the South.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley on August 23 is forecasted to be 82 degrees and Sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On August 24, the forecast is 79 degrees and Sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. On August 18, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On August 19, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On August 21, the forecast is 81 degrees and Sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. On August 22, there is moderate or heavy rain in the area with thunder, with a 52% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the South.", "time_sec": 7.639, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [2