{"id": "736", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages of up to 160 characters, while MMS allows you to send messages with pictures, sounds, videos, and text, with a larger content size of up to 300KB.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "time_sec": 2.366, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 374, 429, 29909, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 1172, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 386, 4826, 6605, 646, 6777, 264, 8131, 1379, 315, 2213, 705, 311, 220, 18, 15, 15, 29862, 304, 19721, 315, 88330, 11, 54562, 11, 479, 333, 11, 4992, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1345, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0194, -0.0009, -0.083, -0.1632, -0.268, -0.0001, -0.0014, -0.2014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2286, -0.272, -0.033, -1.2072, -0.4341, -0.0014, -0.0029, -0.3542, -0.7905, -0.0464, -0.1163, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0224, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.2861, -0.0001, -0.0072, -0.0002, -0.0046, -0.0003, -0.1063, -0.0061, -0.0006, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0021, -0.0532, -0.0011, -0.0356, -1.029, -0.0001, -0.7565, -0.0121, -0.0632, -0.0343, -0.001, -0.0637, -0.0015, -0.0001, -0.1003, -0.0, -0.0