{"id": "52", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, reducing the risk of gingivitis, cleaning better around the teeth and gums, and eliminating tough-to-remove germs and plaque from the gum line.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 3.251, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0746, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0134, -0.0009, -0.0589, -0.2978, -0.0095, -0.0, -0.0133, -0.3489, -0.1023, -0.0244, -0.631, -0.0808, -0.0001, -1.0557, -0.0745, -0.4976, 0.0, -0.0018, -0.0002, -0.8245, -0.0556, -0.3899, -0.0012, -