{"id": "62", "question": "set default browser to windows", "gt": "Method 1 of 2 in passage 2 provides the steps to set the default web browser in Windows 7.", "pred": "These steps are specific to setting Google Chrome as the default browser. For other browsers like Mozilla Firefox, the process is slightly different.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open the Settings app by clicking the Settings icon in the Start menu or using the Windows + I keyboard shortcut.\n2. Click on the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\n4. Scroll down to the Web browser section.\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as the default browser.\n\nThese steps are specific to setting Google Chrome as the default browser. For other browsers like Mozilla Firefox, the process is slightly different.", "time_sec": 4.814, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 738, 279, 1638, 6929, 304, 5515, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 18458, 279, 11296, 4603, 304, 279, 5145, 5022, 476, 1667, 279, 5515, 488, 358, 13625, 37115, 624, 17, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 1156, 2999, 24849, 739, 320, 5493, 11, 21969, 11, 10500, 11, 2355, 4292, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 38452, 11, 4205, 7899, 10500, 624, 19, 13, 22392, 1495, 311, 279, 4895, 6929, 3772, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 10349, 6929, 4343, 320, 269, 894, 6929, 1008, 1091, 17225, 8, 311, 16400, 22201, 458, 906, 11, 323, 1221, 4205, 5085, 17225, 311, 738, 432, 438, 279, 1638, 6929, 382, 9485, 7354, 525, 3151, 311, 6243, 5085, 17225, 438, 279, 1638, 6929, 13, 1752, 1008, 32857, 1075, 34733, 25929, 11, 279, 1882, 374, 10078, 2155, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1173, -