{"id": "100", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "To sync an audiobook from iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open iTunes on your computer.\n2. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n3. Download the audiobook from iTunes onto your iPhone.\n4. Connect your iPhone to the USB cable and plug the other end of the USB cable into a USB port on the computer.\n5. Wait for iTunes to sync the audiobook to your iPhone.\n6. After the sync is complete, the audiobook will be on your iPhone.", "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "time_sec": 3.916, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 3