{"id": "102", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to sync audiobooks from iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. Click on the \"Audiobooks\" tab on the left side of the iTunes window.\n4. Check the boxes next to the audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your computer to your iOS device. To do this, follow these steps:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n3. Click on the \"Books\" tab on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from your computer to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Import\" button to transfer the selected audiobooks to your iPhone.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "time_sec": 3.931, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 553, 13295, 279, 3745, 1790, 311, 1181, 2265, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.5244, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.082, -0.0016, -0.1096, -0.4063, -0.0122, -0.5815, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.1494, -0.0016, -0.0029, -0.0017, -0.2834, -0.1823, -0.0031, -0.0135, -0.4186, -0.0081, -0.0001, -1.0379, -0.2259, -0.001, -0.0035, -0.683, -0.2614, -0.1313, -0.1278, -0.001, -0.0006, -0.0312, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.2347, -0.0387, -0.0636, -0.1128, -0.0007, -0.0898, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.8159, -0.202, -0.2027, -1.1147, -0.393, -0.5764, -0.0008, -0.185, -0.0413, -0.3958, -0.2409, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3023, -0.0001, -0.0, -1.3712, -0.0033, -0.0088, -0.01, -0.065, -0.0301, -0.0057, -0.2656, -0.6377, -0.655, -0.022, -0.0215, -0.0027, 0.0, -0.1213, -0.0125, -0.0158, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.9089, -1.0351, -0.0701, -0.4866, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.1125, -0.4793, -0.2369, -0.1326, -0.06, -0.4323, -0.7248, -0.017, -0.0003, -0.4342, -0.1929, -0.0079, -0.0436, -0.0005, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0121, -0.0501, -0.