{"id": "108", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind of the northeast trade winds and are located on the southeastern side of the Caribbean Sea. The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are located on the northwestern side of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind. The windward side receives more rain and is wetter, while the leeward side is drier but still receives some rain.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "time_sec": 1.844, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 13, 576, 512, 24035, 29000, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 2686, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 294, 7253, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2675, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0095, -0.0005, -0.0643, -0.0067, -0.104, -0.0001, -0.003, -0.659, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.0034, -0.0, -0.002, -0.1454, -0.2476, -0.2153, -0.1551, -0.0, -0.0982, -0.7563, -0.6998, -0.0003, -0.0037, -0.2168, -1.2427, -0.6349, -0.0062, -0.0512, -0.1515, -0.6385, -0.0128, -0.0114, -0.0012, -1.0148, -1.0618, -0.0785, -0.0, -0.0019, -0.4744, -0.2242, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0, -