{"id": "111", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the main difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is their exposure to the wind and precipitation. The Windward Islands are exposed to the northeasterly trade winds and receive more rainfall, making them wetter and more humid, while the Leeward Islands are located on the leeward side of the mountains and receive less rainfall, making them drier. Therefore, the answer to the question is:\n\nThe Windward Islands are wetter and more humid due to their exposure to the northeasterly trade winds, while the Leeward Islands are drier and receive less rainfall.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "time_sec": 1.923, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 13, 576, 512, 24035, 29000, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 2686, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 294, 7253, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2675, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0095, -0.0005, -0.0643, -0.0067, -0.104, -0.0001, -0.003, -0.659, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.0034, -0.0, -0.002, -0.1454, -0.2476, -0.2153, -0.1551, -0.0, 