{"id": "119", "question": "teresa name meaning", "gt": "The name Teresa is of Greek, American, Italian, and Spanish origin. In Greek and American, it means 'Reap; from Therasia.' In Italian, it is interpreted as 'Harvester.' In Spanish, the name is associated with two popular saints, 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux.' The name is also thought to originate from the Greek “therizein” meaning “to harvest, harvester” or from the Greek “theros” meaning “summer”.", "pred": "The name Theresa is also mentioned, which is a Greek baby name with a similar meaning to Teresa. In Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the name Teresa has different meanings depending on its origin:\n\n1. Greek Meaning: The name Teresa is a Greek baby name. In Greek, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n2. American Meaning: The name Teresa is an American baby name. In American, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Reap; from Therasia.\"\n3. Italian Meaning: The name Teresa is an Italian baby name. In Italian, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Harvester.\"\n4. Spanish Meaning: The name Teresa is a Spanish baby name. In Spanish, the meaning of the name Teresa is \"Name of two popular saints 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux'.\"\n\nThe name Theresa is also mentioned, which is a Greek baby name with a similar meaning to Teresa. In Greek, the meaning of the name Theresa is \"Reaper; from Therasia.\"", "time_sec": 7.021, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 829, 63440, 702, 2155, 49700, 11649, 389, 1181, 6238, 1447, 16, 13, 17860, 48103, 25, 576, 829, 63440, 374, 264, 17860, 8770, 829, 13, 758, 17860, 11, 279, 7290, 315, 279, 829, 63440, 374, 330, 693, 391, 26, 504, 663, 9247, 685, 10040, 17, 13, 3693, 48103, 25, 576, 829, 63440, 374, 458, 3693, 8770, 