{"id": "130", "question": "difference between vietnam and india", "gt": "The passages suggest that trends in India are more typical than those in Vietnam, particularly in the area of education. Vietnam's education system is described as relatively equitable, where poorer children receive the same treatment as their better-off counterparts. In contrast, India's early focus was on getting children into school, which involved setting up schools, and training teachers. Politically, India supported Vietnam's independence from France and opposed American involvement in the Vietnam War. Both countries have a history of colonialism, with India being a former colony of the United Kingdom and Vietnam of France. Post-colonization, India experienced division and conflict among Hindus, Muslims and Sikhs. Cultural and economic links between India and Vietnam date back to the 2nd century.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between Vietnam and India lies in their education systems and historical relationships. Vietnam's education system is relatively equitable, ensuring that poorer children receive the same opportunities as those who are better-off. In contrast, India's early focus was on getting children into school, which involved looking at resources and facilities, setting up schools, and training teachers. Additionally, Vietnam and India have strong bilateral relations, with cultural and economic links dating back to the 2nd century. India supported Vietnam's independence from France and opposed American involvement in the Vietnam War, while France lost the colony of Indochina, modern-day Vietnam, shortly after World War II.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between Vietnam and India lies in their education systems and historical relationships. Vietnam's education system is relatively equitable, ensuring that poorer children receive the same opportunities as those who are better-off. In contrast, India's early focus was on getting children into school, which involved looking at resources and facilities, setting up schools, and training teachers. Additionally, Vietnam and India have strong bilateral relations, with cultural and economic links dating back to the 2nd century. India supported Vietnam's independence from France and opposed American involvement in the Vietnam War, while France lost the colony of Indochina, modern-day Vietnam, shortly after World War II.", "time_sec": 4.743, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 22500, 323, 6747, 15448, 304, 862, 6731, 5942, 323, 13656, 11871, 13, 22500, 594, 6731, 1849, 374, 12040, 76009, 11, 22573, 429, 65181, 2841, 5258, 279, 1852, 10488, 438, 1846, 879, 525, 2664, 12462, 13, 758, 12872, 11, 6747, 594, 4124, 5244, 572, 389, 3709, 2841, 1119, 2906, 11, 892, 6398, 3330, 518, 4963, 323, 12786, 11, 6243, 705, 8682, 11, 323, 4862, 13336, 13, 22406, 11, 22500, 323, 6747, 614, 3746, 51203, 4300, 11, 448, 12752, 323, 6955, 7746, 4924, 1182, 311, 279, 220, 17, 303, 9294, 13, 6747, 7248, 22500, 594, 23665, 504, 9625, 323, 16087, 3693, 21587, 304, 279, 22500, 5004, 11, 1393, 9625, 5558, 279, 40936, 315, 2263, 4953, 2210, 11, 6481, 11228, 22500, 11, 19620, 1283, 4337, 5004, 7946, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0356, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0131, -0.0009, -0.1086, -0.3369, -0.8927, -0.0031, -0.0168, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.5687, -0.0628, -0.1633, -1.0222, -0.0386, -0.3639, -0.6177, -0.9034, -0.815, -0.5739, -0.3977, -0.0953, -0.0006, -0.0126, -0.6517, -0.005, -0.0076, -0.4903, -0.2454, -0.0637, -0.0016, -0.0677, -0.0589, -0.0, -1.2611, -0.0141, -0.3909, -0.5546, -0.0005, -0.1333, -0.2258, -0.6501, -0.5977, -0.0605, -0.0008, -0.5658, -0.5401, -0.6831, -0.1314, -0.1989, -0.0264, -0.0557, -0.0005, -0.0008, -0.024, -0.2682, -0.7568, -0.4445, -0.9761, -0.0013, -0.0013, -0.2022, -0.0017, -0.0551, -0.012, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.000