{"id": "261", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "time_sec": 3.914, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 1181, 49449, 553, 279, 2487, 624, 20, 