{"id": "271", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "time_sec": 2.83, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 320, 1958, 1045, 3198, 340, 23, 13, 444, 1090, 11417, 291, 2090, 476, 294, 96645, 4152, 311, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 5943, 304, 6543, 7262, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2576, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0246, -0.0007, -0.0667, -0.1136, -0.0026, -0.0129, -0.062, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.2986, -0.7924, -0.1013, -0.0003, -0.9754, -0.0, -0.0298, -0.5316, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0375, -0.0, -0.0349, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0055, -0.0, -0.0111, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0029, -0.0002, -0.484, -0.4553, -0.0001, -0.1213, -0.0013, -0.4728, -0.0028, -0.0, -0.1557, -0.0002, -0.4708, -0.1443, -0.0, -0.0433, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2387, -0.0073, -0.9277, -1.2166, -0.2329, -0.0929, -0.5093, -0.3031, -0.0, -1.8054, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0232, -0.338, -0.1242, -0.0001, -1.1907, -0.0, -0.2919, -0.79, -0.0091, -0.0356, -0.8091, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.3969], "cumulative_logprob": -15.0637, "norm_logp": -0.1907, "input_len": 407, "output_tokens": 79, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.44, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "276", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition characterized by significant bone density loss, resulting in weakened bones and increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden and severe back pain, loss of height over time, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, fractures, particularly in the spine or hips, are likely to occur.", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "time_sec": 3.911, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 3