{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "time_sec": 3.927, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 624, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1391, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0243, -0.0004, -0.0709, -0.2275, -0.0042, -0.0, -0.0268, -0.0, -0.0086, -0.0296, -0.6228, -0.0276, -0.0016, -0.0471, -0.6874, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0109, -0.0664, -0.0016, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.6502, -0.031, -0.0002, -0.0042, -0.0, -0.0155, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3643, -0.3243, -0.0011, -0.0021, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0034, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.8166, -0.0077, -0.0, -0.0152, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0149, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0043, -0.0436, -0.0004, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.0384, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0048, -0.0, -0.0022, -0.0043, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0004, -0.0012, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.2253, -0.0009, -0.0011, -0.0011, -0.0006, -0.0011, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.194, -0.0055, -0.0, -0.0147, -0.0056, -0.0001, -0.0012, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0017, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0915, -0.0037], "cumulative_logprob": -4.9076, "norm_logp": -0.0409, "input_len": 404, "output_tokens": 120, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits:\n\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It helps combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.\n\n2. **Physical Fitness**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness, depending on how hard one pushes during a hike.\n\n3. **Accessibility**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, which is a good way of getting to know an area.\n\n4. **Sunlight Exposure**: Being exposed to sunshine while hiking increases levels of vitamin D, which is beneficial for overall health.\n\nThese benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "time_sec": 7.15, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 266