{"id": "471", "question": "what is the difference between refined and unrefined coconut oil", "gt": "Refined coconut oil is made from dried coconut fruit, has no discernible taste or smell, and has a higher smoking point of 450 degrees F, making it suitable for high-temperature cooking. On the other hand, unrefined coconut oil is made from fresh coconut flesh, carries a mild coconut flavor and aroma, and has a lower smoking point of 350 degrees F.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between refined and unrefined coconut oil lies in their composition, taste, and heat tolerance. Refined coconut oil is made from the dried coconut fruit, while unrefined coconut oil, also known as pure or virgin coconut oil, is made from the flesh of fresh coconuts. Unrefined coconut oil has a distinct aroma and flavor that is lost during refining. Refined coconut oil has a higher smoking point of 450 degrees F compared to unrefined coconut oil's 350 degrees F, making it suitable for high-temperature cooking methods like frying. Additionally, refined coconut oil is deodorized, resulting in no discernible taste or smell, whereas unrefined oil carries a mild coconut flavor and aroma.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between refined and unrefined coconut oil lies in their composition, taste, and heat tolerance. Refined coconut oil is made from the dried coconut fruit, while unrefined coconut oil, also known as pure or virgin coconut oil, is made from the flesh of fresh coconuts. Unrefined coconut oil has a distinct aroma and flavor that is lost during refining. Refined coconut oil has a higher smoking point of 450 degrees F compared to unrefined coconut oil's 350 degrees F, making it suitable for high-temperature cooking methods like frying. Additionally, refined coconut oil is deodorized, resulting in no discernible taste or smell, whereas unrefined oil carries a mild coconut flavor and aroma.", "time_sec": 5.548, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 37191, 323, 650, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 15448, 304, 862, 18037, 11, 12656, 11, 323, 8628, 24098, 13, 431, 4006, 33457, 5590, 374, 1865, 504, 279, 31620, 33457, 13779, 11, 1393, 650, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 11, 1083, 3881, 438, 10526, 476, 35899, 33457, 5590, 11, 374, 1865, 504, 279, 24955, 315, 7722, 1062, 443, 6128, 13, 1230, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 702, 264, 12460, 54179, 323, 17172, 429, 374, 5558, 2337, 73185, 13, 431, 4006, 33457, 5590, 702, 264, 5080, 19578, 1459, 315, 220, 19, 20, 15, 12348, 434, 7707, 311, 650, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 594, 220, 18, 20, 15, 12348, 434, 11, 3259, 432, 14452, 369, 1550, 12, 34558, 17233, 5413, 1075, 86096, 13, 22406, 11, 37191, 33457, 5590, 374, 409, 48917, 1506, 11, 12942, 304, 902, 41545, 1238, 12656, 476, 22068, 11, 19853, 650, 1097, 1589, 5590, 23377, 264, 23034, 33457, 17172, 323, 54179, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1511, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0093, -0.0006, -0.0634, -0.1673, -0.3616, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.5748, -0.037, -0.4429, -1.724, -0.2034, -1.1461, -0.0098, -0.1273, -0.4959, -0.0174, -0.5171, -0.3263, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.0239, -0.0309, -0.0089, -0.6977, -0.0022, -0.0178, -0.0039, -0.3581, -0.4332, -0.0019, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0314, -0.0005, -0.4448, -0.062, -0.5376, -0.0, -0.0064, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.0234, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0308, -0.0675, -0.0034, -0.0264, -0.1439, -0.0, -0.0708, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0639, -0.3615, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0073, -0.0001, -0.4622, -0.0016, -0.0747, -0.0669, -0.0006, -0.0032, -0.6338, -0.2105, -0.0432, -0.0037, -0.6448, -0.408, -1.0721, -0.0, -0.001, -0.0001, -0.0991, -0.0014, -0.3186, -0.026, -0.0001, -0.114, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0028, -0.2016, -0.2856, -0.0, -0.6396, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0067, -0.0003, -0.2094, -0.0808, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0392, -0.0304, -0.