{"id": "481", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "time_sec": 2.095, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0718, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.032, -0.0007, -0.024, -0.2615, -0.0013, -0.0779, -0.9559, -0.0221, -0.0002, -0.5685, -0.1057, -0.7713, -0.5776, -0.0018, -0.1005, -0.0272, -0.2389, -0.3533, -0.2354, -1.1666, -0.761, -0.6304, -0.1379, -0.093, -0.1914, -0.0018, -0.7105, -0.