{"id": "483", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that Snapchat may lock accounts that use third-party applications to access the platform more than four times. If a user has been locked out of their account and doesn't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. Third-party apps are applications that are not developed or officially supported by Snapchat, such as third-party messaging or camera apps. Using these apps may put the user's account at risk, as well as their friends'. Additionally, there are many reasons why people are getting locked out of Snapchat, including using third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "time_sec": 2.197, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0718, 