{"id": "491", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "gt": "You can tell who liked your tweet by using websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm, or by going to Twitter.com and logging in with your Twitter username and password. Once logged in, click on your Twitter name, located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, then click on Settings and finally Blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. By setting this feature, you will receive an email notification whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can tell who liked your tweet by using a website that tracks favorited tweets. One such website mentioned is Favotter.net. To use this website, you need to go to Twitter.com, log in with your Twitter username and password, click on your Twitter name located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, click on the Settings option that appears in the drop-down menu, and then click on the blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. This will allow you to set up your account so that you're notified via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can tell who liked your tweet by using a website that tracks favorited tweets. One such website mentioned is Favotter.net. To use this website, you need to go to Twitter.com, log in with your Twitter username and password, click on your Twitter name located on the upper right hand corner of your account's Home page, click on the Settings option that appears in the drop-down menu, and then click on the blue Notifications link at the top of the screen. This will allow you to set up your account so that you're notified via email whenever someone marks one of your tweets as one of their favorites.", "time_sec": 5.127, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 879, 14915, 697, 11809, 553, 1667, 264, 3910, 429, 13918, 4694, 1608, 23150, 13, 3776, 1741, 3910, 9733, 374, 80941, 354, 465, 5071, 13, 2014, 990, 419, 3910, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 728, 311, 6271, 905, 11, 1487, 304, 448, 697, 6271, 5934, 323, 3552, 11, 4205, 389, 697, 6271, 829, 7407, 389, 279, 8416, 1290, 1424, 9131, 315, 697, 2692, 594, 5379, 2150, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 11296, 2999, 429, 7952, 304, 279, 5943, 14875, 5022, 11, 323, 1221, 4205, 389, 279, 6303, 52938, 2656, 518, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 4171, 13, 1096, 686, 2138, 498, 311, 738, 705, 697, 2692, 773, 429, 498, 2299, 29216, 4566, 2551, 15356, 4325, 15423, 825, 315, 697, 23150, 438, 825, 315, 862, 26574, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0901, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0359, -0.0014, -0.065, -0.3914, -0.0018, -0.1752, -0.0003, -0.0013, -0.0025, -0.0095, -0.0659, -0.3186, -1.0194, -0.1961, -0.7874, -1.0179, -1.398, -0.019, -0.0011, -0.3099, -1.494, -0.2646, -0.1156, -0.6045, -0.5238, -0.0581, -0.0066, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.4447, -0.9215, -0.2385, -0.3623, -0.3106, -0.0311, -0.3779, -0.3177, -0.0013, -1.0555, -0.0014, -0.2885, -0.0435, -0.5765, -0.0037, -0.0006, -0.0543, -0.0, -0.1182, -0.0051, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0431, -0.3989, -0.0001, -0.0214, -0.0063, -0.0012, -0.6826, -0.085, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0033, -0.5848, -0.0008, -0.0061, -0.0142, -0.0013, -0.014, -0.0275, -0.0005, -0.0216, -0.737, -0.0003, -0.003, -0.0241, -0.0002, -0.1175, -0.0001, -0.0011, -0.0004, -0.0008, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.0079, -0.1163, -0.2226, -0.0062, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0231, -0.0013, -0.0, -0.0043, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0006, -0.0005, -0.1418, -1.4858, -0.1041, -0.1689, -0.001, -0.0002, -0.2442, -0.0006, -0.235, -0.0011, -0.1826, -0.0032, -0.0004, -0.0491, -0.0006, -0.0028, -0.0001, -0.0027, -0.0002, -0.0112, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0783, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0008, -0.0487, -0.4638], "cumulative_logprob": -20.5404, "norm_logp": -0.1556, "input_len": 577, 