{"id": "541", "question": "lyrics he was a friend of mine", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the lyrics \"he was a friend of mine\" are from the song \"He Was a Friend of Mine\" written by Bob Dylan.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the lyrics \"He was a friend of mine\" are part of a song that was recorded by various artists including the Greenbriar Boys, the Briarwood Singers, Bobby Bare, and Petula Clark. The song was released in 1963 and 1964. The lyrics are repeated multiple times in the song, emphasizing the bond between the singer and the person being referred to as a friend. The song also mentions the friend's death and the singer's sadness over it.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the lyrics \"He was a friend of mine\" are part of a song that was recorded by various artists including the Greenbriar Boys, the Briarwood Singers, Bobby Bare, and Petula Clark. The song was released in 1963 and 1964. The lyrics are repeated multiple times in the song, emphasizing the bond between the singer and the person being referred to as a friend. The song also mentions the friend's death and the singer's sadness over it.", "time_sec": 3.535, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 23261, 330, 1519, 572, 264, 4238, 315, 10485, 1, 525, 949, 315, 264, 5492, 429, 572, 12433, 553, 5257, 13511, 2670, 279, 7840, 65, 461, 277, 29757, 11, 279, 54758, 277, 6660, 10833, 388, 11, 37381, 60792, 11, 323, 11333, 5607, 21304, 13, 576, 5492, 572, 5880, 304, 220, 16, 24, 21, 18, 323, 220, 16, 24, 21, 19, 13, 576, 23261, 525, 11504, 5248, 3039, 304, 279, 5492, 11, 80903, 279, 10815, 1948, 279, 22757, 323, 279, 1697, 1660, 13862, 311, 438, 264, 4238, 13, 576, 5492, 1083, 33845, 279, 4238, 594, 4545, 323, 279, 22757, 594, 50878, 916, 432, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0982, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0286, -0.0022, -0.2623, -0.1187, -0.0879, -0.