{"id": "572", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).", "time_sec": 1.799, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 2736, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 990, 279, 2701, 3137, 27459, 1447, 16, 13, 12836, 619, 49328, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 1959, 34469, 320, 6282, 8, 488, 27974, 320, 30047, 568, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1161, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0186, -0.0032, -0.0817, -0.3965, -0.981, -0.5761, -0.2738, -0.3897, -0.2358, -0.0014, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0182, -0.0936, -0.0013, -0.1659, -0.357, -0.4749, -0.002, -0.563, -0.6352, -0.592, -0.0646, -0.5779, -1.0759, -0.1396, -0.0002, -0.359, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0641, -0.005, -0.0002, -0.4535, -0.404, -0.2092, -0.0035, -0.0036, -0.0006, -0.0023, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.7982, -0.0545], "cumulative_logprob": -10.1944, "norm_logp": -0.208, "input_len": 447, "output_tokens": 49, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 43.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "St