{"id": "604", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that both cycling and aerobic exercise have their benefits, but there are some differences to consider.\n\nPassage 2 suggests that cycling may be more suitable for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic problems due to its low-impact nature. Additionally, passage 3 states that stationary cycling provides the lowest impact workout compared to other indoor exercises like the treadmill and rowing machine.\n\nHowever, it's important to note that aerobic exercise, such as running, can also be beneficial for overall health and fitness. Passage 1 encourages individuals to view a wide variety of physical activities as challenges and find their fitness Zen, suggesting that different types of exercise may be better suited to different people depending on their goals and preferences.\n\nTherefore, I cannot definitively say which is better, cycling or aerobic exercise, based on the given passages. Both types of exercise have their advantages and disadvantages, and the best choice will depend on the individual's specific needs and goals.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may not be ideal for individuals who, due to arthritic or other orthopedic problems, are unable to walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. The indoor exercise, or stationary, bike provides you with the lowest impact workout compared to the treadmill and rowing machine, according to WebMD. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may not be ideal for individuals who, due to arthritic or other orthopedic problems, are unable to walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. The indoor exercise, or stationary, bike provides you with the lowest impact workout compared to the treadmill and rowing machine, according to WebMD. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.", "time_sec": 4.311, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 90390, 10158, 374, 2664, 1091, 32062, 13, 63050, 30806, 10158, 11, 1741, 438, 4303, 476, 32062, 11, 374, 1661, 369, 498, 7241, 498, 525, 264, 14680, 3746, 1515, 13, 59970, 374, 2441, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 448, 6884, 14303, 323, 897, 11, 714, 432, 1231, 537, 387, 10507, 369, 7775, 879, 11, 4152, 311, 796, 339, 49208, 476, 1008, 29199, 16367, 292, 5322, 11, 525, 11889, 311, 4227, 369, 458, 11577, 4168, 315, 882, 2041, 6646, 476, 16829, 13, 576, 29519, 10158, 11, 476, 52635, 11, 12963, 5707, 498, 448, 279, 15457, 5421, 25242, 7707, 311, 279, 84646, 323, 2802, 287, 5662, 11, 4092, 311, 4895, 6076, 13, 15277, 11, 90390, 10158, 374, 2664, 1091, 32062, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0622, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0265, -0.0011, -0.0231, -0.7968, -0.0218, -0.5985, -0.25, -0.8381, -0.0134, -0.4992, -0.427, -0.0028, -0.0166, -0.3999, -0.6196, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.1398, -0.0024, -0.0006, -0.0496, -0.7327, -0.0022, -0.5233, -0.6077, -0.0006, -0.0023, -0.008, -0.0146, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0843, -0.1192, -0.3998, -0.161, -0.0151, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.4439, -0.0303, -0.0001, -0.0258, -0.0018, -0.2333, -0.134, -0.0413, -0.5642, -0.635, -0.0029, -0.202, -0.0015, -0.0484, -0.3908, -0.7021, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0112, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0015, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0072, -0.0042, -0.001, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0045, -0.0, -0.0011, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.