{"id": "628", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you can stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, you can keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player and defend against them with tips from an experienced basketball player.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "time_sec": 3.315, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 11, 5310, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 624, 18, 13, 13655, 264, 63685, 1948, 279, 14024, 323, 279, 15183, 2781, 624, 19, 13, 5443, 10414, 504, 458, 10321, 19240, 2781, 311, 7269, 697, 9055, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1952, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0137, -0.0009, -0.1076, -