{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\n\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "time_sec": 4.064, "record_pro