{"id": "653", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "To properly clean your hair, first select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Ensure your water is warm but not too hot, and thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a bit of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair. If your hair is long, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles rather than piling it on your head. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove any tangles. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and let it stay on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Pat dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoid rubbing it with the towel as it can cause damage. For complete drying, a hair dryer can be used.", "pred": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\n\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 7.114, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 8427, 279, 6169, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 11, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 2484, 279, 6396, 1495, 10078, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 279, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 8, 311, 279, 32452, 315, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 279, 6869, 11, 3614, 287, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 421, 279, 6869, 374, 5021, 624, 22, 13, 20552, 264, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 498, 9251, 279, 61932, 11, 10693, 432, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 624, 24, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 11, 30426, 55935, 279, 6869, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 448, 264, 42613, 311, 5358, 5557, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0596, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0187, -0.0003, -0.1876, -0.4812, -0.0009, -0.0006, -0.0045, -0.0, -0.284, -0.0945, -0.0035, -0.0015, -0.312