{"id": "683", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to get free VoIP service and phone numbers:\n\n1. Free DID (incoming numbers) from around the world: There are several companies offering free or paid VoIP services that provide incoming numbers from around the world. These numbers can be obtained by signing up for a VoIP service provider and paying a flat yearly rate or monthly fee.\n2. Get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google: According to the passage, Google offers free virtual phone numbers that can be used to place and receive calls using the internet. To get a free number, visit the author's YouTube channel and follow the instructions provided.\n3. Cloud VoIP Service: The passage mentions a cloud VoIP service that provides toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number (including cell phones) or used with a SIP device. While there is no direct mention of free service, the passage does indicate that the pricing has been lowered.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. None of the passages provide detailed information on how to get free VoIP service and phone numbers without any additional costs or requirements.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\n\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\n\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.", "time_sec": 3.359, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 633, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 264, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 279, 13370, 5496, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 20145, 905, 11739, 14, 6198, 321, 17, 15, 18, 22, 624, 17, 13, 10357, 279, 2766, 429, 4933, 1246, 311, 633, 264, 1910, 20721, 14307, 5624, 320, 11169, 3298, 4292, 18, 13, 2126, 697, 1910, 1372, 3351, 504, 264, 30287, 2813, 6941, 5085, 382, 9485, 7354, 686, 8474, 498, 389, 1246, 311, 6851, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 264, 4540, 1372, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2318, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0447, -0.0005, -0.1029, -0.4712, -0.0186, -0.4743, -0.0349, -0.0002, -0.0054, -0.0017, -0.4318, -0.0118, -0.0, -0.2569, -0.5685, -0.0576, -0.5231, -0.04, -0.0009, -0.3161, -0.0019, -0.0, -1.1153, -0.7137, -0.3514, -0.0015, -0.419, -0.0496, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0012, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -1.0393, -0.0013, -0.0, -0.2679, -0.0728, -0.0195, -0.6159, -0.5311, -0.5233, -0.07, -0.013, -0.0003, -0.0004, -0.0336, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0099, -0.3164, -0.0002, -0.3817, -0.0003, -0.0, -1.0406, -0.0748, -0.0041, -0.4443, -0.5915, -0.0037, -0.1356, -0.0652, -0.0021, -0.0142, -0.016, -1.0711, -0.757, -0.0691, -1.0728, -0.5804, -0.0, -1.2302, -0.1068, -0.0003, -0.1848, -0.1239, -0.1056, -0.0558, -0.0, -0.3238, -0.0044, -0.6042, -0.063, -0.0, -0.8717, -0.0114], "cumulative_logprob": -19.7738, "norm_logp": -0.2039, "input_len": 658, "output_tokens": 97, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.85, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "689", "question": "michigan-how much to replace sewer lines", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.\n\nThe passages provided do not contain specific information about the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan or any other location. Passage 2 mentions general cost ranges for sewer line repair and replacement, but these costs are not specific to Michigan and may vary depending on various factors such as location, materials, and labor costs. Passage 3 is a call to action to ask a question on Angie's List, but does not provide any information relevant to the question at hand. Therefore, I cannot provide an answer to the question based on the given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan can vary significantly depending on the extent of the damage and the location of the pipe. If a section of the pipe is beyond repair, it may require pipe replacement, which could cost from $3,000 to around $12,000. If the entire sewer line needs to be replaced, the cost could be even higher. The cost of a sewer line repair or replacement could break the bank.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the cost of replacing sewer lines in Michigan can vary significantly depending on the extent of the damage and the location of the pipe. If a section of the pipe is beyond repair, it may require pipe replacement, which could cost from $3,000 to around $12,000. If the entire sewer line needs to be replaced, the cost could be even higher. The cost of a sewer line repair or replacement could break the bank.", "time_sec": 3.261, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 2783, 315, 24891, 61920, 5128, 304, 14630, 646, 13289, 11941, 11649, 389, 279, 12818, 315, 279, 5557, 323, 279, 3728, 315, 279, 13647, 13, 1416, 264, 3772, 315, 279, 13647, 374, 7797, 12733, 11, 432, 1231, 1373, 136