{"id": "724", "question": "weather in wellesley", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley on August 23 is forecasted to be 82 degrees and Sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On August 24, the forecast is 79 degrees and Sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. On August 18, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On August 19, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On August 21, the forecast is 81 degrees and Sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. On August 22, there is moderate or heavy rain in the area with thunder, with a 52% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the South.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley on August 23 is forecasted to be 82 degrees and Sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On August 24, the forecast is 79 degrees and Sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. On August 18, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On August 19, the forecast is 83 degrees and Sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On August 21, the forecast is 81 degrees and Sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. On August 22, there is moderate or heavy rain in the area with thunder, with a 52% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the South.", "time_sec": 7.712, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 9104, 304, 25006, 642, 3179, 389, 6156, 220, 17, 18, 374, 17595, 291, 311, 387, 220, 23, 17, 12348, 323, 55038, 448, 264, 220, 18, 24, 4, 601