{"id": "735", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "SMS stands for Short Message Service, commonly referred to as a text message, and allows you to send a text message of up to 160 characters to another device. MMS, which stands for Multimedia Messaging Service, is an evolution of SMS. It allows you to send messages that include pictures, video, or audio content to another device. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB. SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, whereas MMS allows a combination of text, pictures, sounds, and videos.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "time_sec": 2.143, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 374, 429, 29909, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 1172, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 386, 4826, 6605, 646, 6777, 264, 8131, 1379, 315, 2213, 705, 311, 220, 18, 15, 15, 29862, 304, 19721, 315, 88330, 11, 54562, 11, 479, 333, 11, 4992, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1345, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0194, -0.0009, -0.083, -0.1632, -0.268, -0.0001, -0.0014, -0.2014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2286, -0.272, -0.033, -1.2072, -0.4341, -0.0014, -0.0029, -0.3542, -0.7905, -0.0464, -0.1163, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0224, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.2861, -0.0001, -0.0072, -0.0002, -0.0046, -0.0003, -0.1063, -0.0061, -0.0006, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0021, -0.0532, -0.0011, -0.0356, -1.029, -0.0001, -0.7565, -0.0121, -0.0632, -0.0343, -0.001, -0.0637, -0.0015, -0.0001, -0.1003, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0007, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0112, -0.0604, -0.0107, -0.0056, -0.0338, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.3012, -0.0009, -0.648, -0.0538, -0.0571, -0.0908], "cumulative_logprob": -8.2263, "norm_logp": -0.1097, "input_len": 619, "output_tokens": 75, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 51.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "737", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "Based on the given passages, SMS stands for Short Message Service and allows you to send a message of up to 160 characters to another device. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send a message including pictures, videos, sounds, text, or any combination of the four. The content of an MMS message has a maximum size of 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, GIF, etc.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text only, while MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif, etc.", "time_sec": 2.23, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 374, 429, 29909, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 1172, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 9185, 11, 10362, 11, 6803, 11, 1467, 11, 476, 894, 10601, 315, 279, 3040, 13, 386, 4826, 6605, 646, 6777, 264, 8131, 1379, 315, 2213, 705, 311, 220, 18, 15, 15, 29862, 304, 19721, 315, 88330, 11, 54562, 11, 479, 333, 11, 4992, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1345, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0194, -0.0009, -0.083, -0.1632, -0.268, -0.0001, -0.0014, -0.2014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2286, -0.272, -0.033, -1.2072, -0.4341, -0.0014, -0.0029, -0.3542, -0.7905, -0.0464, -0.1163, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0224, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.2861, -0.0001, -0.0072, -0.0002, -0.0046, -0.0003, -0.1063, -0.0061, -0.0006, -